    "description": "A beautifully presented three double bedroom, two bathroom semi-detached house offering flexible accommodation over 3 floors. Accommodation comprises of a spacious master bedroom with en-suite bathroom, two further double bedrooms, main bathroom, open-plan kitchen/ reception room, guest WC and a good size cellar. The property is located close to the junction of Balls Pond Road and Henshall Street, providing superb access to the shops and buses of Essex Road, along with the café culture and greenery of Newington Green. Trains can be found at Dalston Junction station and Canonbury station, both of which form part of the London Overground network, along with Highbury & Islington station (National Rail & Victoria Line). Upper Street provides a plethora of bars, restaurants & shops, a real hustle & bustle, with the Underground at Angel. Our China Desk is here for you, if Chinese is your preferred language, please get in touch via WeChat (ChestertonsLettings) Brochures Super-size images and Full Online Details --- Brochure and Particulars Read full description COUNCIL TAX Ask agent PARKING Ask agent GARDEN Terrace ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions Balls Pond Road, Islington, N1 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Chestertons, Islington 327 - 329 Upper Street, Islington, London, N1 2XQ Industry affiliations: Chestertons has over 30 branches across London, and through our relationships with many of the world's major employers, we have a large database of the best quality private and corporate tenants looking for a wide variety of properties. Unlike many other agents, each of our branches are ARLA-qualified. This means that clients can be confident that they are not only dealing with an expert in the local lettings market, but also